the **full SVD** of a matrix
:math:`A \in \mathbb{K}^{m \times n}`, if `k = min(m,n)`, is defined as

.. math::

    A = U \operatorname{diag}(S) V^{\text{H}}
    \mathrlap{\qquad U \in \mathbb{K}^{m \times m}, S \in \mathbb{R}^k, V \in \mathbb{K}^{n \times n}}

